Output assets/fastapi-url-demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 420
Set Shell bash
Set Theme { "name": "fastapi", "black": "#0d1117", "red": "#f85149", "green": "#3fb950", "yellow": "#e3b341", "blue": "#58a6ff", "magenta": "#a371f7", "cyan": "#39c5cf", "white": "#e6edf3", "brightBlack": "#8b949e" }
Type "fastapi-url serve --port 8000"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "   ✓ JWT auth · Database · React dashboard"
Enter
Type "   ✓ API: http://localhost:8000/docs"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# URL shortener · JWT · click tracking · FastAPI"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
